{"audio": "1corinthians-16.opus", "duration_ms": 148429, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 3900, "text": "1 Corinthians, Chapter Sixteen."}, {"start_ms": 5320, "end_ms": 18201, "text": "Now about the collection for the saints, you are to do as I directed the churches of Galatia: On the first day of every week, each of you should set aside a portion of his income, saving it up, so that when I come no collections will be needed."}, {"start_ms": 18801, "end_ms": 23781, "text": "Then, on my arrival, I will send letters with those you recommend to carry your gift to Jerusalem."}, {"start_ms": 24401, "end_ms": 27982, "text": "And if it is advisable for me to go also, they can travel with me."}, {"start_ms": 29022, "end_ms": 33962, "text": "After I go through Macedonia, however, I will come to you; for I will be going through Macedonia."}, {"start_ms": 34542, "end_ms": 40362, "text": "Perhaps I will stay with you awhile, or even spend the winter, so that you can help me on my journey, wherever I go."}, {"start_ms": 41002, "end_ms": 47243, "text": "For I do not want to see you now only in passing; I hope to spend some time with you, if the Lord permits."}, {"start_ms": 48003, "end_ms": 55223, "text": "But I will stay in Ephesus until Pentecost, because a great door for effective work has opened to me, even though many oppose me."}, {"start_ms": 56363, "end_ms": 62944, "text": "If Timothy comes, see to it that he has nothing to fear while he is with you, for he is doing the work of the Lord, just as I am."}, {"start_ms": 63664, "end_ms": 65584, "text": "No one, then, should treat him with contempt."}, {"start_ms": 66144, "end_ms": 71684, "text": "Send him on his way in peace so that he can return to me, for I am expecting him along with the brothers."}, {"start_ms": 72404, "end_ms": 76985, "text": "Now about our brother Apollos: I strongly urged him to go to you with the brothers."}, {"start_ms": 77425, "end_ms": 81765, "text": "He was not at all inclined to go now, but he will go when he has the opportunity."}, {"start_ms": 82745, "end_ms": 83485, "text": "Be on the alert."}, {"start_ms": 84005, "end_ms": 85225, "text": "Stand firm in the faith."}, {"start_ms": 85605, "end_ms": 86505, "text": "Be men of courage."}, {"start_ms": 86845, "end_ms": 87425, "text": "Be strong."}, {"start_ms": 87865, "end_ms": 89065, "text": "Do everything in love."}, {"start_ms": 89905, "end_ms": 96886, "text": "You know that Stephanas and his household were the first converts in Achaia, and they have devoted themselves to the service of the saints."}, {"start_ms": 97626, "end_ms": 102686, "text": "Now I urge you, brothers, to submit to such as these, and to every fellow worker and laborer."}, {"start_ms": 103626, "end_ms": 110647, "text": "I am glad that Stephanas, Fortunatus, and Achaicus have arrived, because they have supplied what was lacking from you."}, {"start_ms": 111087, "end_ms": 113547, "text": "For they refreshed my spirit and yours as well."}, {"start_ms": 114147, "end_ms": 116527, "text": "Show your appreciation, therefore, to such men."}, {"start_ms": 117487, "end_ms": 120247, "text": "The churches in the province of Asia send you greetings."}, {"start_ms": 120787, "end_ms": 126108, "text": "Aquila and Prisca greet you warmly in the Lord, and so does the church that meets at their house."}, {"start_ms": 126708, "end_ms": 128608, "text": "All the brothers here send you greetings."}, {"start_ms": 129228, "end_ms": 130908, "text": "Greet one another with a holy kiss."}, {"start_ms": 131688, "end_ms": 134228, "text": "This greeting is in my own hand—Paul."}, {"start_ms": 134948, "end_ms": 137968, "text": "If anyone does not love the Lord, let him be under a curse."}, {"start_ms": 138588, "end_ms": 139588, "text": "Come, O Lord!"}, {"start_ms": 140389, "end_ms": 142309, "text": "The grace of the Lord Jesus be with you."}, {"start_ms": 142889, "end_ms": 145689, "text": "My love be with all of you in Christ Jesus."}, {"start_ms": 146429, "end